# scripts/opcount: `ratelimitbench bench sliding N` makes N takes of one
# token from sliding windows of 10 tokens per 10ms, over 64 keys, 10µs
# apart (ST1); the cost of one take is the slope between the two sizes.
# The floor keeps each key's grants in a ring; the control and the program
# in a slice that drops its head.
unit take
sizes 200000 1200000
args bench sliding {n}
control benchmarks/ratelimit/testdata/control
floor benchmarks/ratelimit/testdata/floor
